d sequential model components.", "Extend the evaluation to other longitudinal datasets to demonstrate broader applicability.", "Provide more detailed insights into the interpretability of the learned embeddings and their clinical relevance."], "rating": 7, "confidence": 4, "soundness": 3, "presentation": 3, "contribution": 4}
